      "id": "claim_4a29e57bd92b4c159d562b709fa8ea0f",
      "statement": "An investigation is eligible for reaping by reap-investigations only once it has had zero RUNNING ECS tasks for longer than a configurable grace period (GRACE_PERIOD_HOURS, derived from the EFS access point's CreatedAt tag); any investigation with a currently running task is never considered stale regardless of age, and task state is re-verified immediately before deletion.",
